    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70132" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεκτάρεος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έα</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έη</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>nectarous,</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> of garments, i.e. <i>fragrant,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. ἑανός, χιτών,</span>
